== Trivia ==
*The name Odawa likely comes from the American indigenous people of the same name, roughly meaning "Trader".
*Using a {{Item|Wishing Compass}} in the {{Zone|Jungle}} without a {{Item|Jungle Key}} before obtaining a [[Amethyst Crystal]] may point to him.

